              "description": "Hybrid (semantic + lexical) search across the indexed AI-relevant content published by RISE (Research Institutes of Sweden) and AI Sweden. Returns ranked passages with source URLs. Covers Swedish and English material. Vector search handles topical queries; a lexical arm (tsvector with Swedish/English stemming, plus trigram fallback) handles proper nouns and short keyword queries. Filters: `source`, `lang`, `page_type` (event | news | project | page), `limit` (1–50, default 20).",
              "inputSchema": {
